Modified: filtered. Only the examples of these sections are kept: Emphasis
and strong emphasis, Code spans, Links, List items, Lists, Block quotes, ATX
headings and Fenced code blocks (CommonMark), and Autolinks (extension)
(GFM's, in place of CommonMark's Autolinks); less every example whose
markdown holds `\`, `&`, `<`, `![`, `]:`, `"`, a tab, or a line starting
with 4 spaces; each is re-encoded as one JSON line with an
id ("cm/<n>" or "gfm/<n>", the spec's example number). The markdown and the
expected html are the spec's, unchanged. The derived files are shared under
the same license.
